  "createdAt" : 1731968781,
  "description" : "This dataset contains results from the open response items administered as part of the legacy MCAS assessment between 2009-2021. Data is only available for students averaging 2 or above on the open response items in the following years and subjects:\n<ul><li>Grades 3-8 ELA and math: 2007-2016</li><li>Grade 10 ELA and math: 2007-2018</li><li>Grades 5 and 8 STE: 2007-2018</li><li>High school science: 2007-2021</li></ul>The Massachusetts Comprehensive Assessment System (MCAS) is a statewide assessment administered to help parents, students, educators, and policymakers determine where districts, schools, and students are meeting expectations and where they need additional support. For more information about MCAS data, please visit the Department of Elementary and Secondary Education's <a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/help/data.aspx?section=assess\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Profiles Help - About the Data</a> page.\n\nFor overall MCAS results from this assessment, visit the <a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Assessment-and-Accountability/Legacy-MCAS-Achievement-Results/ccsh-ajgw/about_data\">Legacy MCAS Achievement Results</a> dataset. Current (“Next Gen”) MCAS results can be found in the <a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Assessment-and-Accountability/MCAS-Achievement-Results/i9w6-niyt/about_data\">MCAS Achievement Results</a> dataset. PARCC results can be found on the Department of Elementary and Secondary Education's <a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/parcc.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Profiles site</a>. Results from different assessment systems measure different standards and cannot be directly compared. Please see the DESE Researcher's Guide linked as featured content below for more information.\n\nThis dataset contains the same data that is also published on our DESE Profiles site: \n<a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/mcasopenitemresponse.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Legacy MCAS Open Response Item Results</a>",
